# Gates Code

## Applies when

Editing `src/gates/` — schema validation helper and per-gate check modules.

## Source of truth

- [PRD.md](PRD.md) §14 (G1–G6 policy).
- Level A `03-pipeline-gates` (thresholds, retry, fail policy).
- Level A `01-contract-first` (when to validate).
- Foundation: `validate.ts`, `g1Capture.ts`.

## Required behavior

- **`validate.ts`**: single ajv instance + `ajv-formats`; `assertValid(data, schemaName)` throws or returns errors with JSON path; compile schemas once at startup.
- **Gate modules**: one file per gate or `g1Capture.ts`, `g2Audit.ts`, etc.; export `runGateG1(ctx): GateResult` pattern.
- **Read-only**: gates inspect artifacts on disk; never mutate input files or `state.json` directly — return result to orchestrator.
- **G1 implementation** (Foundation):
  - Validate `capture/meta.json` against `capture-meta.schema.json`.
  - `http_status === 200`.
  - Screenshots exist, size > 5120 bytes, dimensions > 0.
  - `text.txt` length ≥ 200 characters.
- **GateResult**: always `{ pass, gate, errors[], warnings? }`; errors human-readable with file paths.
- **Diagnostics on fail**: include `lead_id`, `stage`, `gate`, artifact path, specific reason.
- **No LLM in gates code** except future thin wrappers for G2/G4/G6 critic — not in Foundation.
- **Orchestrator integration**: pipeline calls gate after stage; on `!pass` orchestrator handles retry counting.

## Forbidden behavior

- Do not advance pipeline from inside gate module.
- Do not weaken G1 thresholds (5KB, 200 chars) without PRD update.
- Do not skip schema validation before tech checks.
- Do not import Playwright in gate modules (file-system checks only for G1).
- Do not catch and swallow validation errors.

## Output requirements

- `runGateG1` returns `pass: true` only when all G1 checks satisfied per `03-pipeline-gates`.
- Unit tests: happy path, empty screenshot, short text, invalid schema (when test scaffold exists).

## Verification checklist

- [ ] `assertValid` returns path-qualified errors.
- [ ] G1 fails on missing/empty screenshot and short text.
- [ ] G1 passes on valid Foundation capture output.
- [ ] Gate modules are read-only.
- [ ] No LLM imports in `src/gates/`.
